      "size_bytes": 3166,
      "content_preview": "**Top Artificial Intelligence Conferences** \n- **[NeurIPS](https://www.google.com/search?client=firefox-b-d&q=NeurIPS&mstk=AUtExfAJ5Pj_r9hthP8xBnlEpuaIMAPdBXHRyjriVMhPBBoT79iMbucak0Swl8LVnK_Pa_Y889YqPbHi0e1dlce_MsEl8xyQsLE8vP-vFhmmSmdyiukwbT7fnQ6V3FirDPGOtAGXvXd3I31EEh6A8tAHLXqf7uj_m9jaau4lpu-hI7_RPNSH3ktepO3kOjRpwBr-Ah7lceMN-PWLswn8uXnWjMWOZVpYQsS7QWbbYFXqvsoyxwM5dCt56e9tFSdMsdn_FV1umw7JHRcKoTRoy73nWZsv&csui=3&ved=2ahUKEwiOja3q1MmTAxV2jVYBHemSDxsQgK4QegQIAxAB) (Neural Information Processing Systems):** Often regarded as the top AI conference, highly selective.\n- **[ICML](https://www.google.com/search?client=firefox-b-d&q=ICML&mstk=AUtExfAJ5Pj_r9hthP8xBnlEpuaIMAPdBXHRyjriVMhPBBoT79iMbucak0Swl8LVnK_Pa_Y889YqPbHi0e1dlce_MsEl8xyQsLE8vP-vFhmmSmdyiukwbT7fnQ6V3FirDPGOtAGXvXd3I31EEh6A8tAHLXqf7uj_m9jaau4lpu-hI7_RPNSH3ktepO3kOjRpwBr-Ah7lceMN-PWLswn8uXnWjMWOZVpYQsS7QWbbYFXqvsoyxwM5dCt56e9tFSdMsdn_FV1umw7JHRcKoTRoy73nWZsv&csui=3&ved=2ahUKEwiOja3q1MmTAxV2jVYBHemSDxsQgK4QegQIAxAD) (International Conference on Machine Learning):** Premier conference for machine learning research.\n- **[ICLR](https://www.google.com/search?client=firefox-b-d&q=ICLR&mstk=AUtExfAJ5Pj_r9hthP8xBnlEpuaIMAPdBXHRyjriVMhPBBoT79iMbucak0Swl8LVnK_Pa_Y889YqPbHi0e1dlce_MsEl8xyQsLE8vP-vFhmmSmdyiukwbT7fnQ6V3FirDPGOtAGXvXd3I31EEh6A8tAHLXqf7uj_m9jaau4lpu-hI7_RPNSH3ktepO3kOjRpwBr-Ah7lceMN-PWLswn8uXnWjMWOZVpYQsS7QWbbYFXqvsoyxwM5dCt56e9tFSdMsdn_FV1umw7JHRcKoTRoy73nWZsv&csui=3&ved=2ahUKEwiOja3q1MmTAxV2jVYBHemSDxsQgK4QegQIAxAF) (International Conference on Learning Representations):** Leading venue for deep learning.\n- **[AAAI](https://www.google.com/search?client=firefox-b-d&q=AAAI&mstk=AUtExfAJ5Pj_r9hthP8xBnlEpuaIMAPdBXHRyjriVMhPBBoT79iMbucak0Swl8LVnK_Pa_Y889YqPbHi0e1dlce_MsEl8xyQsLE8vP-vFhmmSmdyiukwbT7fnQ6V3FirDPGOtAGXvXd3I31EEh6A8tAHLXqf7uj_m9jaau4lpu-hI7_RPNSH3ktepO3kOjRpwBr-Ah7lceMN-PWLswn8uXnWjMWOZVpYQsS7QWbbYFXqvsoyxwM5dCt56e9tFSdMsdn_FV1umw7JHRcKoTRoy73nWZsv&csui=3&ved=2ahUKEwiOja3q